Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我真是绝望透了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}How desperate am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.54,0:01:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}幸好钱德不在这儿  谁也惨不过他{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Good thing Chandler's not here, he always wins at this game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.14,0:01:34.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我刚刚告诉我妈   帮她的晚会准备食物{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I just told my Mom I'd cater a party for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.99,0:01:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么这样做   因为我需要钱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}How come? -Because I need the money{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.48,0:01:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}而且我那点仅存的自尊  不要也罢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}and I thought that it'd be a great way to get rid of that last little schmidgen of self-respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.37,0:01:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}别这样  这是一件好事{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Come on, I think this is a good thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.47,0:01:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}老妈若不是觉得你厨艺精湛  才不会雇你呢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't think Mom would've hired you if she didn't think you were good at what you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.32,0:01:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你犯不着替她说好话   她又听不见{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You don't have to stick up for her. She can't hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.43,0:01:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你有水果汁吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Do you have any juice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.49,0:01:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}只有泡菜{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Just pickle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.57,0:02:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}瑞秋  昨天很有趣  我在街上碰见乔安娜了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, Rach, funny story. I, bumped into Joanna on the street yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.30,0:02:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我的老板  乔安娜  很惨吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}My boss, Joanna? That must have been awkward.{\r}
