Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.53,0:02:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你没答应她吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You, you didn't say 'Yes' to that did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没有  没有{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.05,0:02:20.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿  瑞秋{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hello, Rachel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.77,0:02:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}起初我没答应{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, not at first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她在这里做什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What is she doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.60,0:02:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}上次你跟她约会以后  还说她是个反应迟钝的笨女人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't understand! Last time you went out with her you said she was a 'big, dull dud.'{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我过早对她下结论了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, I think I judged her too quickly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}现在我跟她可以做进一步的发展{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}and this time we were able to take the relationship to the next level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}上次我差点被开除  你必须跟她绝交  立刻{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, last time I almost got fired. You must end it, you must end it now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.60,0:02:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我又不是天天有艳遇{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, come on! It's not like this is an everyday occurrence for me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.25,0:02:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}通常我都是独处的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean usually I'm pretty much just in there by myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.50,0:03:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}钱德  答应我{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Chandler! Promise me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}跟她断交{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}you will end this now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.35,0:03:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧   我答应   谢谢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, I promise, I'll end it. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.30,0:03:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}希望你知道  我为了你牺牲很大{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I hope you know what I'm giving up for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她可不光是你的老板而己  懂吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}because she's not just the boss in your office, if you know what I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}抱歉  我只是了解他的意思{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Sorry. I knew what he meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.21,0:03:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}大厨进展的如何了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}How's the hired help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}很顺利  法式咸派快好了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Doing great. Quiches are coming along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这是什么  蓝色指甲油{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What's this? Blue nail polish?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我觉得很好看{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, I thought it was cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你祖母死后  我们发现时  她的手就这样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ha. It's what your grandmother's hands looked like when we found her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想问你一个问题{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Let me ask you a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.28,0:03:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么你要雇我{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why did you hire me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}理查德一直说他晚会的派对餐点很棒{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well Richard raved about the food at his party...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}当然  那时你和他睡过{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}of course you were sleeping with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}而且我听说  在那个女同性恋的婚礼上{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Then I heard the food at that lesbian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你的菜也大受欢迎{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}wedding was very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我假定你没和那里的什么人睡过{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I assume you weren't sleeping with anybody there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}所以  我认为你可能有两把刷子{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Though, at least that would be something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}天啊  你听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, my God! Did you hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.37,0:04:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她雇我是因为  她认为我很优秀{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She hired me because she thinks I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我没听见{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I didn't hear that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.14,0:04:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她不是可怜我{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh yeah, she didn't hire me out of pity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.66,0:04:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不是想在朋友面前刁难我{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}it wasn't so she could pick on me in front of her friends,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.79,0:04:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她是真的觉得我行{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}she actually thinks I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.08,0:04:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}喔   如果你是个同性恋就太酷了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wow! And hey, it's cool if you're a lesbian!{\r}
